Human: Can you tell me the steps to write an if/then statement in C programming language?

Assistant: Sure, here's how you could write an if/then statement in C:
if (condition1) {
  //do something
} 
else if (condition2) {
  //do something else
} 
etc.  You can put as many conditions as you need in the if statement, and you can also put as many "then" statements as you want in the else if statement, and so on. 
I hope that helps!  Let me know if you have any further questions.
